IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rbda-reporting`

-- Registration of Births and Deaths Act 2021, ss 2(1), 7, 8, 10, 19-23, 26, 28, 32, 33, 35, 42, 48, 51 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_registration-of-births-and-deaths-act-2021.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

