§ `Penalties`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `failing to report a birth, death or stillbirth` EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `failing to provide birth particulars` EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `a doctor failing to send particulars within 24 hours` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `ignoring an information notice` EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `a false or misleading statement` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `obstruction` EQUALS 2500

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to report a birth, death or stillbirth` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to provide birth particulars` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `a doctor failing to send particulars within 24 hours` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `ignoring an information notice` EQUALS 1
